<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Ben Oxley">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm Ben — a builder who's been around the block a few times. Sysadmin turned software
    engineer turned whatever-it-takes-to-make-things-work. I spend my time on infrastructure,
    tooling, automation, and the occasional hardware project.
  </p>
  <p>
    When I'm not at a terminal, you'll find me tinkering with networking gear, messing
    around with 3D printing, or working on some ill-advised weekend project that sounded
    better on Friday night than it does on Sunday morning.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site runs on <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a> with zero tracking, zero
    JavaScript by default, and one overengineered favicon.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>